            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko tweho, ko tur’ ab’ umurango, twirinde ibiboreza, twambaye icuma gikīngīra igikiriza c’ukwizera n’urukundo, kandi twambaye nk’inkofero ukwizigira agakiza.",
          "type": "text",
